message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "secp2560k1 — A Verifiable 2560-Bit Koblitz-Family Curve Generated by the SEC Prescription"
abstract: >-
  An independent re-derivation and certification of the elliptic curve secp2560k1:
  the Koblitz curve over the prime field of order 2^2560 - 2^320 - 132200237 defined
  by y^2 = x^3 + 7, with group order N = p + 1 - t. The report certifies the
  primality of the field and of the order, re-derives the base-point ritual from
  scratch, certifies the trace, the cofactor, the sextic twist and the order-three
  endomorphism, and measures joint GLV against wNAF. It also runs the generation
  prescription at full scale over 11,016,687 candidates and reports a negative
  result: the claim that the constant 132200237 is the first admissible value is
  false. The curve is the 14th and largest of fourteen candidates of the same shape.
  Scope is the curve only; no protocol or signature scheme is certified.
